# Live loopback checks for review round 4 F1/F2 (defensive, local probe)
# Machine: Apple M2 Pro, 12 cores, 32 GB; macOS 27.2.1
# Busy machine: load averages are printed per run; timings are development observations.
# Ports: F1 node 47341/47342; F2 honest 47311/47312, victim 47321/47322, baseline 47331/47332.
# Probe: a scratch Rust client over minibtc-p2p's codec (outside the repo). flood = replay one real header in 2,000-header messages; withhold = serve 3,000 real headers, never a block.
# Params: devnet with pow_target_timespan_blocks 1000000, max_future_time_secs 100000.

